     A* ======================================================================
     A* ORDAUD - Order Audit Log
     A* Author: Arnav    Created: 2026-10-05
     A*
     A* Written only by trigger program ORDTRG (Sprint 7), never by screens.
     A* AUDUSER instead of the PDF's USER - USER is reserved in RPG and SQL.
     A*
     A* Change log:
     A*   2026-10-05  Arnav  Created (Sprint 1)
     A* ======================================================================
     A          R ORDAREC                   TEXT('Order audit record')
     A            ORDNO          7P 0       TEXT('Order number')
     A                                      COLHDG('Order' 'No')
     A            ACTION         1A         TEXT('Action A=Add U=Upd D=Del')
     A                                      COLHDG('Act')
     A            AUDDATE         L         DATFMT(*ISO)
     A                                      TEXT('Audit date')
     A                                      COLHDG('Audit' 'Date')
     A            AUDTIME         T         TIMFMT(*ISO)
     A                                      TEXT('Audit time')
     A                                      COLHDG('Audit' 'Time')
     A            AUDUSER       10A         TEXT('User who made the change')
     A                                      COLHDG('User')
